Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> programa
Rule 1     programa -> reservar
Rule 2     programa -> consultar
Rule 3     reservar -> RESERVAR recurso STRING DATA DATE HORA_INICIO TIME HORA_FIM TIME
Rule 4     consultar -> CONSULTAR RESERVAS
Rule 5     consultar -> CONSULTAR RESERVAS ATIVAS
Rule 6     consultar -> CONSULTAR RESERVAS CANCELADAS
Rule 7     recurso -> SALA
Rule 8     recurso -> LABORATORIO
Rule 9     recurso -> EQUIPAMENTO

